0,1,,status,Victoria,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":1,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
1,1,,status,Mio,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":2,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
2,1,,status,Benjamin,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":3,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
3,1,,status,Jonathan,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
4,1,,status,Minato,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
5,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Since we've grown from three to five, our old arrangement is a bit like wearing a child's coat. We need a sustainable system that doesn't leave us shivering or resentful.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Mio,,I totally agree! But let's make sure the new way isn't a total headache to manage. I don't want anyone spending their whole Sunday night doing math!,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"I think it's important we find a way to be objectively fair. I've heard some whispers about people carrying others, and I'd rather we solve that now.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"I agree we need a change, but I'm concerned about the financial volatility. I want to understand the actual yearly costs and any potential setup fees before we commit.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minato,,I just want us all to be happy again. Sometimes it feels like we're upset with each other because of the bills. Can we find a way to stop that?,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Jonathan, ""objectively fair"" is a noble goal, though often a slippery slope. Perhaps we should look at how other houses handle this to avoid reinventing the wheel?","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Mio,,"Exactly! @Benjamin, that's a great idea. If we can find a template or a system that already works, it'll save us so much time and stress.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"A template would be helpful, but I also think we need hard data on our own usage. We can't fix a problem we haven't measured.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Victoria,,I agree with Jonathan. We need to see the historical data. I'm particularly worried about the spikes in winter; we need to know the range of our monthly expenses.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Minato,,I think it would be good to see how we've been paying so far. Maybe we can see where the misunderstandings started?,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,A fair point. I'm curious if the physical layout of the house—like which rooms get the most sun—affects the heating costs. It would be a shame to penalize someone for a cold room.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Mio,,"Oh, that's a good point! But again, let's not make the calculation so complex that it takes hours to figure out every month. Simplicity is key!","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"I'm less worried about the time spent and more about the peace of mind. If we know exactly who is using what, the rumors of unfairness will vanish.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Victoria,,"While I value fairness, I'm also wary of expensive modifications. If we're talking about installing new meters or equipment, we need to know the cost first.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Minato,,I hope we don't spend too much time arguing about the numbers. I just want us to be kind to each other when we ask for payment.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"Indeed, kindness is far more pleasant than a spreadsheet. Let's gather some data on historical costs and external models to find a balanced path forward.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Mio,,"Yay! Let's do it! I'll look for things that make the admin side easier. I really want to avoid a ""bill-calculating nightmare"" for whoever does it!","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,I will focus on the actual usage data. I want to see if there is a significant disparity between the rooms to ensure no one is being unfairly burdened.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Victoria,,I will look into the long-term financial patterns and the costs of any technical changes. I need to be sure this is sustainable for my budget.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Minato,,"I'll look into the payment history. I want to see if there's a pattern to when people get upset, so we can fix the feeling in the house.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
